   "data": {
    "text": "EFFECTS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 5, CC 33 to 48\n   1 Wind\n   2 Chaos\n   3 Cloth reacts\n   4 Impacts per beat\n   5 Breaks\n   6 Settle time\n   7 Weight\n   8 Fur length\n   9 Clumping\n  10 Frizz\n  11 Hair color\n  12 Shine\n  13 Fur reacts to\n  14 Fur lag\n  15 Element\n  16 Thickness\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 5, CC 49 to 64\n   1 Growth\n   2 Curl\n   3 Splash\n   4 Scattered things\n   5 Fire lights the scene\n   6 Forces in the air\n   7 Cloth\n   8 Things that crash and break\n   9 Bits in the air\n  10 Hair and fur\n  11 Water and liquids\n  12 Smoke and fire\n  13 suite: Storm\n  14 suite: Hearth\n  15 suite: Brawl\n  16 suite: Slow motion\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 5, CC 65 to 80\n   1 suite: Drenched\n   2 suite: Backlit fluff\n   3 suite: Windblown\n   4 suite: Avalanche\n   5 suite: Drift\n   6 suite: Underwater\n   7 suite: Shampoo ad hair\n   8 suite: Puddle stomp\n   9 pair: When impacts rise, the shake rises\n  10 pair: When something crashes, the camera shakes\n  11 pair: When something heavy lands, hair and cloth settle a beat later\n  12 pair: When the wind picks up, cloth flies out\n  13 pair: When the wind picks up, hair streams one way\n  14 pair: When it rains, hair goes stringy\n  15 pair: When the water churns, foam builds\n  16 pair: When things break, the mess spreads\nCV-CC 4: MIDI channel 5, CC 81 to 96\n   1 pair: When a strong edge light hits from behind, the hair shines\n   2 pair: When something shatters, pieces scatter across the floor\n   3 pair: When things feel heavy, they land and stop fast\n   4 pair: When things bounce like rubber, the comedy turns cartoon\n   5 pair: When the fur is long, it trails behind the move\n   6 pair: When fur lags behind the body, the move takes longer to settle\n   7 pair: When fur gets soaked, it clumps flat\n   8 pair: When a pet's fur is soaked flat, it looks pitiful and funny\n   9 pair: When the wind picks up, the hair frizzes\n  10 pair: When fire is in the scene, it flickers light across faces\n  11 pair: When firelight floods the scene, the light turns warm\n  12 pair: When the smoke keeps building, it becomes a wall\n  13 pair: When smoke becomes a wall, the world shrinks to one person\n  14 pair: When the air turns chaotic, smoke breaks into curls\n  15 pair: When a splash bursts, the edit drops into slow motion\n  16 pairs: Weather hits everyone\nCV-CC 5: MIDI channel 5, CC 97 to 103\n   1 pairs: The impact chain\n   2 pairs: The elements build\n   3 pairs: Bath time disaster\n   4 pairs: Long coat in motion\n   5 pairs: Lost in the smoke\n   6 pairs: Fire takes the room\n   7 pairs: Splash hang time"
