  {
   "id": 45,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "CHARACTER ARC\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 6, CC 1 to 16\n   1 Arc stage\n   2 Role in the scene\n   3 Dramatic role\n   4 Which way they change\n   5 The lie they believe\n   6 The old wound\n   7 Fighting the change\n   8 The test\n   9 Slipping back\n  10 How the change shows\n  11 A mentor's lesson\n  12 The mirror character\n  13 The moment they see it\n  14 Giving it up\n  15 suite: Growing up\n  16 suite: The fall\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 6, CC 17 to 32\n   1 suite: The steady one\n   2 suite: Refuses to change\n   3 suite: The mirror ending\n   4 suite: Mentor at their best\n   5 suite: The mentor's road\n   6 suite: Dark mirror\n   7 pair: When the lie is exposed, the crisis comes\n   8 pair: When the old wound is touched, they fight the change harder\n   9 pair: When the test is passed, the change shows\n  10 pair: When they slip back, their road drops\n  11 pair: When they fight the change with jokes, the laughs rise\n  12 pair: When the change comes, the posture opens\n  13 pair: When a character becomes the spark in a scene, the plot takes a turn\n  14 pair: When someone is set up as the lead's opposite, the lead's flaw becomes obvious\n  15 pair: When a character is growing, the change starts to show on the outside\n  16 pair: When a character is falling, they slip back into old habits\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 6, CC 33 to 42\n   1 pair: When the lesson comes back at the key moment, the test is passed\n   2 pair: When the mentor dies, grief follows\n   3 pair: When the hero sees themself in the mirror character, they understand\n   4 pair: When the mirror character clashes harder, the hero fights the change\n   5 pair: When they see it, they give something up\n   6 pair: When they give it up, the change shows\n   7 pair: When the lie grips harder, they cannot see the truth\n   8 pair: When a character sees the truth, the background stretches\n   9 pairs: The arc engine\n  10 pairs: Finally seeing"
