   "data": {
    "text": "HERD MENTALITY\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 8, CC 17 to 32\n   1 Herd mentality\n   2 Who leads the herd\n   3 Dissenter\n   4 Group pressure\n   5 The crowd turns\n   6 The lone voice wins them over\n   7 Copying the others\n   8 A rumor spreads\n   9 suite: A mob forms\n  10 suite: The lone voice\n  11 suite: Mob rule\n  12 suite: One against many\n  13 pair: When someone defies the group, the pressure rises\n  14 pair: When the herd grows, doubts go quiet\n  15 pair: When one loud voice leads the group, the pressure to agree builds\n  16 pair: When a rumor spreads further, the crowd turns\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 8, CC 33 to 39\n   1 pair: When the rumor becomes a monster, the pressure builds\n   2 pair: When people copy each other more, the herd moves as one\n   3 pair: When the crowd turns, someone speaks up\n   4 pair: When someone openly defies the group, they start to win them over\n   5 pair: When the lone voice wins them over, the crowd turns\n   6 pairs: The group closes ranks\n   7 pairs: From rumor to rally"
