  {
   "id": 111,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "COMEDY FROM THE MIX\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 13, CC 81 to 96\n   1 How different the personalities are\n   2 Chaos in an orderly room\n   3 Gap in rank\n   4 What the mix does to the plot\n   5 What the mix does to the characters\n   6 Laughs from the mix\n   7 The double act\n   8 The straight man\n   9 The odd one out\n  10 Clash of egos\n  11 Who knows what\n  12 Who sides with whom\n  13 The unwanted guest\n  14 Chemistry\n  15 Everything stops\n  16 Comic montage\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 13, CC 97 to 112\n   1 The punching bag\n   2 Making something tiny epic\n   3 Chase played for laughs\n   4 The near miss\n   5 Funny music\n   6 The narrator joke\n   7 Everyone plays along\n   8 suite: Comedy from the mix lens\n   9 suite: Straight one and funny one\n  10 suite: Chaos agent\n  11 suite: The odd couple\n  12 suite: Calm in the madness\n  13 suite: Doesn't belong here\n  14 suite: The petty war\n  15 suite: Everyone knows but one\n  16 suite: Status swap\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 14, CC 1 to 16\n   1 suite: The worst possible guest\n   2 suite: Banter\n   3 suite: Trickster stirs the pot\n   4 suite: Shifting loyalties\n   5 suite: Door-slamming farce\n   6 suite: Slapstick chase\n   7 suite: Wry narrator\n   8 suite: Dry double act\n   9 pair: When a chaos character enters an orderly room, the cringe rises\n  10 pair: When opposite personality types share the room, more of the laughs come from the mix\n  11 pair: When the gap in rank grows, the plot takes a turn\n  12 pair: Pride before a fall\n  13 pair: When the unwanted guest arrives, the room falls into chaos\n  14 pair: When the egos clash, the plot takes a detour\n  15 pair: When the one who doesn't know gets close to the secret, the cringe rises\n  16 pair: When the chaos grows, the straight man's calm sells the laugh\nCV-CC 4: MIDI channel 14, CC 17 to 32\n   1 pair: When the odd one out tries harder, the group pulls away\n   2 pair: When the sides switch, the status flips\n   3 pair: When the chemistry grows, the characters change\n   4 pair: When the calm one finally loses it, the biggest laugh lands\n   5 pair: When a comic pair trades lines faster, the spark between them grows\n   6 pair: When the room stops dead, the record scratches\n   7 pair: When the room stops, the cringe rises\n   8 pair: When the comic montage starts, the cuts land on the beat\n   9 pair: When the montage shows failed attempts, the disaster escalates\n  10 pair: When the punching bag keeps losing, our sympathy grows\n  11 pair: When the punching bag finally wins big, the release floods in\n  12 pair: When something tiny is made epic, the picture slows down\n  13 pair: When the epic fuss cuts hard to reality, a smash cut pops it\n  14 pair: When a comic chase picks up, things crash\n  15 pair: When the near misses pile up, the room falls into chaos\n  16 pair: When two people miss each other by a second, the tension jumps\nCV-CC 5: MIDI channel 14, CC 33 to 44\n   1 pair: When the funny music stops dead, the silence gets the laugh\n   2 pair: When the music copies every step, the physical comedy gets bigger\n   3 pair: When the narrator jumps in with an intro, the frame freezes\n   4 pair: When the voice-over says one thing and the picture shows another, the narrator joke lands\n   5 pair: When everyone plays along, the absurdity grows\n   6 pairs: The mix makes it funny\n   7 pairs: The house party engine\n   8 pairs: The secret in the room\n   9 pairs: The pair that grows\n  10 pairs: Epic fuss, then popped\n  11 pairs: Chase to crash\n  12 pairs: Farce at the doors"
